                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【Requests】[REQ AUD] - Shania Twain - Little Miss Twain Bonus Tracks]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/shania-twain-little-miss-twain-bonus-tracks.305116/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					There are 4 bonus tracks across the album's many pressings... "We Just Met" from the iTunes and webstore exclusive vinyl (which has already been <a href="https://sharemania.us/threads/shania-twain-we-just-met.304924/" class="internalLink">requested and filled</a> on here), "What's Going On In There" from the HMV CD and Walmart editions, "Trippin' On Good Luck" from the Target vinyl and HMV vinyl, and "Hate That Way" from the Amazon edition. Does anyone have the latter 3 tracks?
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
                <author><![CDATA[soulatlantic]]></author>
